msgid ""
"Telegram is not reachable from the router: the direct path is blocked by the "
"carrier and no working proxy tunnel was found. Start SSClash (or route the "
"router through a VPN) and try again."
msgstr ""
"Telegram недоступен с роутера: прямой путь закрыт оператором, а работающего "
